{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Decodes an unrecognised value to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":" instead of throwing.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"decoder","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decoder","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The synthesised "},{"code":"RawRepresentable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" initializer stays strict — ","type":"text"},{"code":"init(rawValue:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for a value that is not a case — so code that deliberately parses a raw string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps its check. Only DECODING, where the alternative is failing a whole response, is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lenient.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/init(from:)-757he","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile\/init(from:)-757he"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO4fromACs7Decoder_p_tKcfc","title":"init(from:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","tex